e": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "4-39", "text": "Vulnerability Detection Result", "bbox": [95.67, 569.5, 249.29, 579.47], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "4-40", "text": "It was detected that the host implements RFC1323/RFC7323.", "bbox": [95.67, 581.4, 393.32, 591.36], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "4-41", "text": "The following timestamps were retrieved with a delay of 1 seconds in-between:", "bbox": [95.67, 593.35, 497.77, 603.31], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "4-42", "text": "Packet 1: 3214206322", "bbox": [95.67, 605.31, 200.11, 615.27], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "4-43", "text": "Packet 2: 877209543", "bbox": [95.67, 617.26, 194.89, 627.23], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "4-44", "text": "Impact", "bbox": [95.67, 641.63, 131.0, 651.6], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "4-45", "text": "A side e\u001bect of this feature is that the uptime of the remote host can sometimes be computed.", "bbox": [95.67, 653.59, 507.89, 663.55], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "4-46", "text": ". . . continues on next page . . .", "bbox": [95.67, 666.34, 223.67, 676.3], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}]}, {"width": 595.2760009765625, "height": 841.8900146484375, "items": [{"id": "5-0", "text": "2", "bbox": [89.29, 66.49, 94.26, 76.45], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F56"}, {"id": "5-1", "text": "RESULTS PER HOST", "bbox": [104.23, 66.49, 204.86, 76.45], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F56"}, {"id": "5-2", "text": "6", "bbox": [501.0, 68.68, 505.97, 78.64], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-3", "text": ". . . continued from previous page . . .", "bbox": [353.99, 101.96, 510.51, 111.92], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-4", "text": "Solution:", "bbox": [95.67, 126.26, 140.16, 136.23], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "5-5", "text": "Solution type:", "bbox": [95.67, 138.22, 166.06, 148.18], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "5-6", "text": "Mitigation", "bbox": [166.06, 138.22, 216.15, 148.18], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-7", "text": "To disable TCP timestamps on linux add the line 'net.ipv4.tcp_timestamps = 0' to", "bbox": [95.67, 150.17, 511.99, 160.14], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-8", "text": "/etc/sysctl.conf. Execute 'sysctl -p' to apply the settings at runtime.", "bbox": [95.67, 162.13, 395.72, 172.09], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-9", "text": "To disable TCP timestamps on Windows execute 'netsh int tcp set global timestamps=disabled'", "bbox": [95.67, 174.08, 511.95, 184.05], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-10", "text": "Starting with Windows Server 2008 and Vista, the timestamp can not be completely disabled.", "bbox": [95.67, 186.04, 506.39, 196.0], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-11", "text": "The default behavior of the TCP/IP stack on this Systems is to not use the Timestamp options", "bbox": [95.67, 197.99, 511.97, 207.96], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-12", "text": "when initiating TCP connections, but use them if the TCP peer that is initiating communication", "bbox": [95.67, 209.95, 511.93, 219.91], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-13", "text": "includes them in their synchronize (SYN) segment.", "bbox": [95.67, 221.91, 317.83, 231.87], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-14", "text": "See the references for more information.", "bbox": [95.67, 233.86, 269.7, 243.82], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-15", "text": "A\u001bected Software/OS", "bbox": [95.67, 270.12, 205.03, 280.09], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "5-16", "text": "TCP implementations that implement RFC1323/RFC7323.", "bbox": [95.67, 282.08, 354.56, 292.04], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-17", "text": "Vulnerability Insight", "bbox": [95.67, 306.39, 199.24, 316.35], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "5-18", "text": "The remote host implements TCP timestamps, as de\u001cned by RFC1323/RFC7323.", "bbox": [95.67, 318.34, 453.51, 328.31], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-19", "text": "Vulnerability Detection Method", "bbox": [95.67, 342.65, 256.28, 352.61], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "5-20", "text": "Special IP packets are forged and sent with a little delay in between to the target IP. The", "bbox": [95.67, 354.61, 511.96, 364.57], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-21", "text": "responses are searched for a timestamps. If found, the timestamps are reported.", "bbox": [95.67, 366.56, 444.28, 376.52], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-22", "text": "Details:", "bbox": [95.67, 378.52, 128.73, 388.48], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-23", "text": "TCP Timestamps Information Disclosure", "bbox": [128.73, 378.45, 326.41, 388.42], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "5-24", "text": "OID:1.3.6.1.4.1.25623.1.0.80091", "bbox": [95.67, 390.47, 231.68, 400.44], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-25", "text": "Version used:", "bbox": [95.67, 402.43, 153.29, 412.39], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F37"}, {"id": "5-26", "text": "2023-12-15T16:10:08Z", "bbox": [153.29, 402.37, 262.2, 412.33], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "5-27", "text": "References", "bbox": [95.67, 426.74, 149.38, 436.7], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F53"}, {"id": "5-28", "text": "url: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1323", "bbox": [95.67, 438.63, 356.72, 448.59], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "5-29", "text": "url: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7323", "bbox": [95.67, 450.58, 356.72, 460.55], "size": 9.96, "color": 0, "font": "F55"}, {"id": "5-30", "text": "url: https://web.archive.org/web/20151213072445/http://www.microsoft.com/en-us